 "summary": "The PR reuses `PDF.comap`, `Equiv.swap`, the existing `f2LO`, and `Meson.LightFlavor.charge` rather than redefining an isospin involution, a neutron density, or a flavour type; proofs delegate to Mathlib (`Equiv.sum_comp`, `Fintype.sum_eq_add`, `Finset.sum_sub_distrib`, `tendsto_finsetSum`). Greps of Mathlib, Physlib/PhyslibAlpha/QuantumInfo, TauCeti and `EpsilonEridani/` found no existing declaration these replace, and the light-flavour corollaries are the roadmap's named 2.4/3.4 targets.",
